# Reason: exact SystemUI crash calls setPluginFaceWidgetCallback from PluginFaceWidget-BG; the AOD setter constructs FaceWidgetPluginLifeCycle and triggers LifecycleRegistry.setCurrentState main-thread enforcement.
# Affected: three pinned BZI6 SystemUI Smali classes via a strict M4/G965F helper, finalization integration and compiled/ext4 image gates. Each connect generation and raw plugin identity is checked before dispatch.
# Verify: source/output class hashes, Apktool build, APK decode roundtrip, helper guard checks; actual boot/thread latency and reconnect/UI behavior remain pending.
# Rollback: reverse this patch and rebuild original BZI6 SystemUI. No AOD/Infinity feature is removed; no runtime assertion is disabled.

